with LCM before entering Tipam sands; keep pills staged on surface.","source_doc":"DDR NHK-07 · 2016-11-02","event_date":"2016-11-02","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"NHK-07 · 2,480 m"},{"id":85,"well_id":"NHK-07","depth_m":2924.0,"formation":"Tipam","event_type":"Mud Loss","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":12.3,"mud_weight_ppg":10.3,"description":"Sudden loss of returns at 2,924 m MD in Tipam; loss rate 16 bbl/hr. Standpipe pressure dropped 165 psi.","mitigation":"Staged LCM (calcium carbonate + fibre) and drilled ahead at reduced pump rate with continuous pit monitoring.","lesson_learned":"Loss zones in Tipam correlate across the field; anticipate them at similar depth.","source_doc":"WCR NHK-07","event_date":"2016-11-27","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"NHK-07 · 2,924 m"},{"id":86,"well_id":"NHK-07","depth_m":2988.0,"formation":"Barail","event_type":"Torque Spike","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":2.5,"mud_weight_ppg":10.7,"description":"Erratic torque (10-16 kft-lb) with pack-off tendency at 2,988 m MD in Barail coal/shale.","mitigation":"Lowered RPM, added lubricant to mud system and reamed the interval before drilling ahead.","lesson_learned":"Monitor the torque trend, not the absolute value, when drilling Barail.","source_doc":"DDR_NHK-07_2016-11-02.pdf","event_date":"2016-11-02","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"NHK-07 · 2,988 m"},{"id":87,"well_id":"NHK-07","depth_m":3012.0,"formation":"Barail","event_type":"Stuck Pipe","severity":"High","severity_rank":2,"npt_hours":22.0,"mud_weight_ppg":10.8,"description":"String stuck at 3,012 m MD in Barail after 35 min static during survey. Overpull 110 klbs, no rotation. Freed after 9 hrs of jarring and a 40 bbl pipe-freeing pill.","mitigation":"Applied controlled overpull to 110 klbs, spotted pipe-freeing agent and regained rotation after 9 hrs; reamed interval twice.","lesson_learned":"Avoid static pipe across Barail coal seams; keep pipe movin